---
const skills = [
  "Python",
  "PHP",
  "SQL",
  "Django",
  "Django REST Framework",
  "FastAPI",
  "Laravel",
  "PostgreSQL",
  "MariaDB",
  "MySQL",
  "SQLAlchemy",
  "Redis",
  "Docker",
  "Nginx",
  "WebSockets",
  "AWS",
  "DigitalOcean",
  "CI/CD",
];
---

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line-soft/60">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-4" data-reveal>
      <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-sm tracking-wide text-primary">[ 04 · about ]</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
        The engineer behind the systems
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6" data-reveal>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-body">
        <p class="measure">
          I&rsquo;m Mohammed Adib. That&rsquo;s the formal name.
          Teammates and friends know me as Adib Bin Billal, and GitHub knows
          me as
          <a
            href="https://github.com/adib-the-noob"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="whitespace-nowrap text-body underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-primary"
            >@adib-the-noob<span
              class="ml-0.5 inline-block align-middle text-[0.75em] leading-none"
              aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span
            ></a
          >.
          I&rsquo;m a backend software engineer from Dhaka who cares about the
          parts of the product nobody screenshots: billing that reconciles,
          queues that drain, and queries that stay fast at 10,000 customers.
        </p>
        <p class="measure text-muted">
          By day I engineer MetroVPS at Flarezen: a white-label B2B
          platform with multi-layer billing and resource management across
          providers, resellers and customers. Before that: e-commerce
          infrastructure at LakLak Market, and real-time backends at Maverick
          Softwares.
        </p>
        <p class="measure">
          I believe boring technology is underrated. Clear beats clever.
          Reliable beats impressive.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal class="mt-12">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-faint uppercase">
          Toolkit
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {
            skills.map((skill) => (
              <li class="rounded-full border border-line bg-elevated px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-muted transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 hover:text-body">
                {skill}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <dl
        data-reveal
        class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 border-t border-line-soft/60 pt-8 font-mono text-sm sm:grid-cols-4"
      >
        <div>
          <dt class="text-faint">Focus</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-body">Backend × Systems</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-faint">Based</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-body">Dhaka, BD</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-faint">Studying</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-body">B.Sc. SWE · DIU &rsquo;29</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-faint">Status</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-body">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ok"></span>
            Open to work
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-faint">
        Languages: English (business) · Bengali (native)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
